                                "sense_id": "d12f4f29-8590-3935-8a43-bde2d30b57ed",
                                "text": "The mules […] were alternately aswim and walking, the length of our team constituting our greatest safety; for when the wheel mules would be out of their depth, the lead and middle ones might not be over knee-deep, and vice versâ,"
