                                "sense_id": "d12f4f29-8590-3935-8a43-bde2d30b57ed",
                                "text": "By this generous, almost communistic imagery, we are all aswim in the same great gene pool, or fishers from the river of human perpetuity. If my line comes up empty, perhaps you will share your catch with me."
